   "html": "<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"numeral-watermark\">05</div>\n  <div class=\"masthead\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">What This Means — Next Steps</p>\n    <h1 class=\"headline\">The Loop To Put Into Practice</h1>\n  </div>\n  <svg width=\"1152\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 1152 56\" style=\"position:absolute;top:194px;left:64px;\">\n    <defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" fill=\"#3F7A4F\"/></marker></defs>\n    <path d=\"M1080 40 C 760 0, 400 0, 80 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3F7A4F\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.55\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n    <text x=\"576\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"tag\" fill=\"#3F7A4F\">until it's done</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:262px;left:64px;right:64px;display:flex;gap:18px;\">\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;\"><h4 style=\"font-size:20px;\">Capture together</h4><p style=\"font-size:22px;\">Write live in a shared space — everyone watches the words land.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;\"><h4 style=\"font-size:20px;\">Decide</h4><p style=\"font-size:22px;\">Decisions live on the board: To do, In progress, In review, Done.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;\"><h4 style=\"font-size:20px;\">Assign</h4><p style=\"font-size:22px;\">Turn it into a task — owner gets the note link, reason, deadline.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;\"><h4 style=\"font-size:20px;\">Follow up</h4><p style=\"font-size:22px;\">Checked in until Done — Blocked alerts the assigner right away.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"panel\" style=\"position:absolute;top:452px;left:64px;right:64px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"font-size:22px;margin:0 0 8px;\">Bring your team in</h4>\n    <p class=\"body-text\">Share a space's six-character code, or invite by email. Sharing is by consent — the creator of a note or space is its admin, and can share a single note, several, or a whole project.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer\"><span>Getting started with GroveStudio</span><span>05 / 06</span></div>\n</div>",
    "narration": "The whole loop is meant to be lived, not just read: capture together in a shared space, decide on the board, assign with a note link and a deadline, and let GroveStudio follow up until it's marked done. Getting a team into that loop just takes a space's six-character code or an email invite — and because sharing is by consent, the person who created the note or space stays its admin, choosing to share one note, several, or the whole project."
